# CI checks the parity oracle (narthur/skills, for internal/record's parity gate) out
# here. It must be IGNORED, not merely untracked: `git status --porcelain` lists
# untracked paths, so the mutation-score step's clean-tree guard aborted on it.
.parity-oracle/
# CI writes the verbose record-package test output here so the next step can assert the
# parity gate did not skip. Ignored for the same reason as above: the mutation-score step
# runs afterwards and its clean-tree guard counts untracked paths.
record.log
